                "padding-left": "2.5rem",
                "li": {
                  "margin-bottom": "1rem",
                  "position": "relative",
                  "& when (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "list-style": "none",
                    "position": "relative",
                    "padding-left": "1rem",
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-40px",
                      "content": "\"\"",
                      "display": "flex",
                      "justify-content": "center",
                      "align-items": "center",
                      "color": "contrast(@iconColor)",
                      "background-color": "@iconColor",
                      "width": "40px",
                      "height": "40px",
                      "border-radius": "50%",
                      "margin-top": "5px",
                      "& when (@countersType = \"circle\")": {
                        "background": "none",
                        "border": "1px solid @iconColor",
                        "color": "@iconColor"
                      },
                      "& when (@countersType = \"square\")": {
                        "border-radius": "0"
                      },
                      "& when (@mark)": {
                        "content": "\"✓\""
                      }
                    }
                  },
                  "& when not (@stylizedCounters)": {
                    "&:before": {
                      "position": "absolute",
                      "left": "-1.6rem",
                      "content": "\"\\2022\"",
                      "color": "@iconColor",
                      "font-weight": "bold",
                      "font-size": "2rem",
                      "width": "1.6rem",
                      "line-height": "1.2"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"12\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#18356a\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Convenient Daily Wellness Support:</b></span><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\">&nbsp;SodaTide may provide a way for one to conveniently add nutritional supplements to their existing health regimen. Convenience may work wonders in ensuring that consumers adhere to a set schedule, especially those who have a preference for doing simple things in life. The real benefits are dependent on the content of the product in question.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Easy to Incorporate Into a Routine:</b>&nbsp;It will be more realistic to have a wellness product that works well within the normal life routine of a person. The SodaTide product can be taken as per the serving instruction given by its manufacture. The integration of taking supplements with the daily routines will assist users in remembering their routines; however, it is not advisable to take excess.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Complements a Balanced Lifestyle: </b>SodaTide could also be considered an addition to a bigger picture of your overall health regime. Healthy diet, exercise, hydration, sufficient sleep, and stress management continue to be essential building blocks. Although a supplement can contribute nutrients, it cannot be used as a replacement for a balanced diet and good habits.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Supports Consistent Nutritional Habits: </b>In the case of certain consumers, a well-defined product of wellness may provide structure to their nutritional intake routine. SodaTide is a part of an ongoing nutrition regimen, provided it is taken in accordance with its guidelines. The exact nutritional benefits of the product will come down to its ingredient composition, which needs to be checked on the label of the product.</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 1.4rem;\"><b>Practical Wellness-Focused Format: </b>A practical format of the product will facilitate the process of nutritional supplementation for those consumers who lead busy lives. SodaTide can be an attractive choice for those customers seeking an additional item to include in their daily routine. However, the exact benefits of the format, dosage, and formula of this product need to be proved.</span></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
